      "side": 1,
      "message": "`key-\u003eboth.offset` is initialized once before the `again:` label (`key-\u003eboth.offset \u003d address % PAGE_SIZE;` at line 570). Overwriting `key-\u003eboth.offset` here before the `goto again;` checks at lines 756 and 764 means that if `goto again;` is taken and the mapping is concurrently replaced by an anonymous page (line 718) or unmapped (so `p3s_futex_page_offset()` returns its fallback `offset` parameter), `key-\u003eboth.offset` will retain the stale slice offset from the previous attempt rather than `address % PAGE_SIZE`.\n\nConsider storing the result of `p3s_futex_page_offset()` in a local variable and assigning `key-\u003eboth.offset \u003d page_offset | FUT_OFF_INODE;` at line 767 after the retry checks succeed.",
